          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_trax_materials": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The four pieces",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "leather",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_trax_materials_body": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>A jewellery box with fitted compartments, so nothing touches anything else; a necklace trunk that is a presentation case and a strongbox in one; a structured briefcase that stands and keeps its shape; and a mini trunk, 25 by 14 by 8 centimetres, the one Trax uses for its gold giveaways. Each in full-grain calf, lined in red Alcantara, with solid brass hardware galvanised in gold.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_trax_materials_body"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_trax_story": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The collaboration",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "silhouette",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_trax_story_body": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Trax NYC works in fine jewellery; we work in leather. The line sits where the two meet: cases built the way a jeweller thinks about presentation and security, made the way we make everything else, by hand, one piece at a time.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_trax_story_body"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_trax_availability": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Availability and enquiries",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "chat_bubble",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_trax_availability_body": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Each design exists as a single piece. When it is sold it is not made again. To ask about a piece, or about a future collaboration, use the form below or write to info@oberndoerferco.com.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
